    {
      "@type": "schema:DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound_thcb",
      "schema:name": "THCB",
      "schema:inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@type": "schema:DefinedTermSet",
        "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound-thcb-scheme"
      },
      "schema:description": "'THCB' is the owner's term, registered as a search string on 2026-11-11 by owner direction (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Its chemical identity is UNCONFIRMED: the repository records no verified chemical name, structure, chemical class, natural occurrence, route/origin, synonym relation or regulatory status for this term, and no external identifier (CAS, ChEBI, Wikidata, PubChem) was verified - none is recorded here and none may be inferred from the query string. The term sits in compound_identity_unverified, an administrative registration-state category, so this placement asserts no route or chemical classification. What the code 'THCB' expands to is not recorded anywhere in this repository, so no chemical name is supplied. Evidence that would move the term out of this category: a documented chemical name with a verified external identifier, or a recorded source naming the substance and its route/origin; the basis belongs in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md.",
      "schema:termCode": "compound_thcb"
    },
    {
      "@type": "schema:DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound_thcp",
      "schema:name": "THCP",
      "schema:inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@type": "schema:DefinedTermSet",
        "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound-thcp-scheme"
      },
      "schema:description": "'THCP' is the owner's term, registered as a search string on 2026-11-11 by owner direction (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Its chemical identity is UNCONFIRMED: the repository records no verified chemical name, structure, chemical class, natural occurrence, route/origin, synonym relation or regulatory status for this term, and no external identifier (CAS, ChEBI, Wikidata, PubChem) was verified - none is recorded here and none may be inferred from the query string. The term sits in compound_identity_unverified, an administrative registration-state category, so this placement asserts no route or chemical classification. ISS-20261015-TAX-027 recorded a decision not to register this term because no name, route placement or identifier evidence existed; the owner's 2026-11-11 scope decision supersedes that decision for this term (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Registering the string does not settle what it denotes. The COA panel entry records THCP as not detected in one sample, which is an observation about that sample, not a placement basis. Evidence that would move the term out of this category: a documented chemical name with a verified external identifier, or a recorded source naming the substance and its route/origin; the basis belongs in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md.",
      "schema:termCode": "compound_thcp"
    },
    {
      "@type": "schema:DefinedTerm",
