      "schema:description": "'THCJD' is the owner's term, registered as a search string on 2026-11-11 by owner direction (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Its chemical identity is UNCONFIRMED: the repository records no verified chemical name, structure, chemical class, natural occurrence, route/origin, synonym relation or regulatory status for this term, and no external identifier (CAS, ChEBI, Wikidata, PubChem) was verified - none is recorded here and none may be inferred from the query string. The term sits in compound_identity_unverified, an administrative registration-state category, so this placement asserts no route or chemical classification. The letters 'JD' are not expanded anywhere in this repository, so no compound identity is inferred from the code. Evidence that would move the term out of this category: a documented chemical name with a verified external identifier, or a recorded source naming the substance and its route/origin; the basis belongs in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md.",
      "schema:termCode": "compound_thcjd"
